#: src/app/screens/shell/signin_dialogs.cpp
msgid ""
"1. Sign in to the workspace in your browser.\n"
"2. Open developer tools (F12) → Application → Cookies → https://app.slack.com, and copy the value of the cookie named “d” (it starts with xoxd-) into Cookie. Browsers hide this cookie from scripts, so it has to be copied by hand.\n"
"3. Enter your workspace address."
msgstr ""
"1. ブラウザでワークスペースにサインインします。\n"
